      {
        "thread_id": "TH2",
        "thread_goal": "Review and finalise the early identification and referral protocol and observation checklist.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 361403,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, following up on our discussion, I've drafted the Early Identification and Referral Protocol (A2) to address T2. The document is linked here. I'd appreciate your feedback, especially from the teaching assistants on how it fits with existing school procedures, as per T11.",
            "mentions": [
              499701,
              511446,
              350111
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "T2",
              "T11"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 499701,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Thanks @361403. I've read through A2. It's a strong start. My main comment is on the parental consent section – we need to use simpler, clearer language to explain exactly what information is shared and when. I've added a suggestion in the doc to mitigate the risk of low family engagement.",
            "mentions": [
              361403
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 511446,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "I agree with @499701 on the consent language. From a practical view, the referral form itself seems a bit long. Could we streamline the questions? Otherwise, the overall process aligns well with our current safeguarding check-ins.",
            "mentions": [
              499701
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 350111,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "I like the flow chart! It looks very professional. Can we add a box for 'observed strengths' too? So it's not all about problems.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 361403,
            "reply_to": "M22",
            "text": "This is all excellent feedback. @499701, great point on consent, I'll simplify it. @511446, I can definitely try to shorten the form. @350111, a strengths-based approach is a great idea, I'll add a small section for that.",
            "mentions": [
              499701,
              511446,
              350111
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
