            "text": "where is the link to the doc",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M25",
            "speaker_id": 511446,
            "reply_to": "M24",
            "text": "It's in @361403's first message, @427511.",
            "mentions": [
              361403,
              427511
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M26",
            "speaker_id": 499701,
            "reply_to": "M23",
            "text": "While we're on this topic, let's also look at the Classroom Observation Checklist (A3) for task T3. I've put together a draft, aiming for something that can be done in 5 minutes. Does this cover the key early signs without creating too much extra work?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3",
              "T3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M27",
            "speaker_id": 511446,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "This looks very practical, @499701. The indicators are clear. I think using this once a week for the children in the programme would be feasible.",
            "mentions": [
              499701
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M28",
            "speaker_id": 350111,
            "reply_to": "M27",
            "text": "Once a week seems like a lot of paperwork. What about once a month?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M29",
            "speaker_id": 499701,
            "reply_to": "M28",
            "text": "A month might be too long to wait for early identification. How about a compromise? We use it weekly for children on 'active watch' and monthly for a general check-in on others in the programme. We can test that frequency during the pilot.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M30",
            "speaker_id": 361403,
            "reply_to": "M29",
            "text": "That's a very sensible approach. It provides flexibility and ensures we're responsive. The indicators on A3 are also relevant from a social work perspective.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M31",
            "speaker_id": 427511,
            "reply_to": "M30",
            "text": "The protocol A2 says it needs to be aligned with organisational guidelines. Who signs off on that?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M32",
            "speaker_id": 361403,
            "reply_to": "M31",
            "text": "Good question, @427511. That's part of T11. Our approval here is to agree on the content for the pilot. I will take the action to share the final pilot version with school leadership and social services management for their formal sign-off post-pilot.",
            "mentions": [
