            "reply_to": "M83",
            "text": "Will do. With all the materials nearly final, let's look at the Pilot Plan (A7). Can we reconfirm the scope and set a start date? We previously agreed on two classes, focusing on wellbeing, engagement, and attendance. Is that still correct?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
